    <statement><p>Find the vector parameterization for the line which passes through <m>P = \left(3,9,2\right)</m> 
with direction vector <m>\mathbf{v} = \left\lt 2,1,2\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p><m>\left\lt 3+2t,9+1t,2+2t\right&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\left\lt 2t,1t,2t\right&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\left\lt 2+3t,1+9t,2+2t\right&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\left\lt 6,9,4\right&gt;</m></p>
</li>
</var></p>
</statement>
    <solution><m>f(t) = \overrightarrow{OP} + t * \mathbf{v} = \left\lt 3,9,2\right&gt; + \left\lt 2,1,2\right&gt; t = \left\lt 3+2t,9+1t,2+2t\right&gt;</m>


</solution>
  </static>
